  "body": "**Space, Style & Easy Living in Stanmore Bay**\r\n\r\nDesigned for modern living, this three-bedroom home combines timeless brick and weatherboard exteriors with a spacious, functional layout. The open-plan kitchen, dining and living area features a walk-in pantry, while a separate living/media room opens onto the deck and pergola for effortless outdoor living. Three generous double bedrooms include a master suite with walk-in wardrobe and ensuite, complemented by a family bathroom and separate WC. A double internal-access garage with laundry and additional driveway parking completes the home.\r\n\r\n**Looking for something uniquely yours? We can custom-design your dream home to suit your lifestyle, vision and Lot 24, Anehana Heights. Contact the Signature Homes team today to explore your options and bring your new home to life.**\r\n\r\nAnehana Heights, located in the scenic Hibiscus Coast region of Auckland, offers an ideal retreat for those looking to escape the hustle of city life. This development features sea views and a serene coastal lifestyle while conveniently close to the upcoming Penlink highway.\r\n\r\n**House & Land features:**\r\n- Three generous double bedrooms\r\n- Master with walk-in wardrobe & ensuite\r\n- Open-plan kitchen, dining & living\r\n- Walk-in pantry\r\n- Separate living/media room\r\n- Family bathroom + separate WC\r\n- Brick & weatherboard exterior\r\n- Double internal-access garage with laundry\r\n- Deck with pergola\r\n- Additional driveway parking\r\n- Pricing includes decks & driveway\r\n- Market-leading Guarantees, including 2 years of maintenance cover\r\n\r\n*This package is priced from and excludes WCIGC, soft landscaping and blinds/curtains*",
